  "environment": "Ego4D影片的觀測影格及短歷史片段，無互動模擬環境。",
  "tasks": "共同預測box、noun、verb、time_to_contact；四種STA指標組合不是四份獨立素材。",
  "data": "annotation以uid、video_id、frame和objects索引；objects含box／noun_category_id／verb_category_id／time_to_contact。訓練標籤有noun+1與依ROI版本決定的verb offset，輸出JSON再還原。",
  "evaluation": "實際validation呼叫OverallMeanAveragePrecision(top_k=5)：IoU嚴格大於0.5、TTC誤差不超過0.25；依GT數折免(K−1)×GT個高分false positives。正式成績依README指定的Ego4D evaluator／隱藏test。",
